{"act":3.0,"chapter_id":1.0,"scenes":[{"duel_player_deck":-4.0,"bg_sound":"SonChap1_1","bg_sound2":"SonChap1_2","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"bg":"sChampPotiron","id":"scene_1","lines":[{"obj1_x":1008.0,"obj1_y":624.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":2.0,"portrait1_name":"","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Le soleil commençait à illuminer les champs. La vue s'ouvrait sur une mer de vignes basse et orange. Une grange et des habitations étaient visibles au loins.","speaker1_x":534.0,"speaker1_y":539.0,"speaker1_w":365.0,"speaker1_h":567.0,"speaker2_x":1413.0,"speaker2_y":537.0,"speaker2_w":384.0,"speaker2_h":569.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0},{"obj1_x":1008.0,"obj1_y":624.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"SlideGauche","portrait2_effect":"SlideGauche","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"sValerius","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"","speaker1_x":857.0,"speaker1_y":542.0,"speaker1_w":365.0,"speaker1_h":567.0,"speaker2_x":551.0,"speaker2_y":542.0,"speaker2_w":384.0,"speaker2_h":569.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0},{"obj1_x":1008.0,"obj1_y":624.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"sValerius","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Kaelen : Nous y voilà. Regardez Valérius, il y a de la fumée au loin.","speaker1_x":857.0,"speaker1_y":542.0,"speaker1_w":365.0,"speaker1_h":567.0,"speaker2_x":551.0,"speaker2_y":542.0,"speaker2_w":384.0,"speaker2_h":569.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0},{"obj1_x":1008.0,"obj1_y":624.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"sValerius","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Valérius : Mais quel est ce bruit? Les fermiers ne laboure pas les terres durant cette saison.","speaker1_x":857.0,"speaker1_y":542.0,"speaker1_w":365.0,"speaker1_h":567.0,"speaker2_x":551.0,"speaker2_y":542.0,"speaker2_w":384.0,"speaker2_h":569.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0},{"obj1_x":1008.0,"obj1_y":624.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"sValerius","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Kaelen et Valérius s'approchèrent, dissimulé dans les haies. Le récolteur n'était pas visible. Par contre, des sangliers se déchainaient, labourant les terres et détruisant les cultures dans une orgie de destruction. Au milieux d'eux se tenait un sanglier colossale aux crocs jaunis. Il semblait diriger à coup de grognement les autres sangliers.","speaker1_x":857.0,"speaker1_y":542.0,"speaker1_w":365.0,"speaker1_h":567.0,"speaker2_x":551.0,"speaker2_y":542.0,"speaker2_w":384.0,"speaker2_h":569.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0},{"obj1_x":1008.0,"obj1_y":624.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Pulse","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":2.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"sValeriusEnerver","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Valérius : Le monstre ! C'est un acte de terreur pour paralyser les fermiers! Il doit déja être la dans la grange à extorquer ses victimes!","speaker1_x":857.0,"speaker1_y":542.0,"speaker1_w":365.0,"speaker1_h":567.0,"speaker2_x":551.0,"speaker2_y":542.0,"speaker2_w":384.0,"speaker2_h":569.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0},{"obj1_x":1008.0,"obj1_y":624.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":2.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"sValerius","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Kaelen, en pointant du doigt le sanglier colossal : \"Ces sangliers ne sont pas des bêtes sauvages. Ils sont commandés par elle. Si nous la neutralisons, ils se disperseront et nous auront l'avantage.\"","speaker1_x":857.0,"speaker1_y":542.0,"speaker1_w":365.0,"speaker1_h":567.0,"speaker2_x":551.0,"speaker2_y":542.0,"speaker2_w":384.0,"speaker2_h":569.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0},{"obj1_x":1008.0,"obj1_y":624.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":2.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"sValerius","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Valérius : \"Etes vous capable de vous en occuper seul ? Avec mes hommes nous allons encerclé la ferme et nous assurer que personne n'entre ou sorte.\"","speaker1_x":857.0,"speaker1_y":542.0,"speaker1_w":365.0,"speaker1_h":567.0,"speaker2_x":551.0,"speaker2_y":542.0,"speaker2_w":384.0,"speaker2_h":569.0,"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0},{"obj1_x":1008.0,"obj1_y":624.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"ob